  "final_correct_sha": null,
  "final_correct_note": "截至 2026-10-16 无合并的正确版本：#4775 开放，维护者分支 issue4775_boilerHeatLoss（30b155fe90）本身另有错误 (see historical_wrong_note of task buildings_4775)。The correct reference used by the control comparison is the fix proposed in issue #4775 (remove + UAOve.Q_flow, i.e. the equation returns to its pre-change form), which equals the pre-change library (variant ctrl_correct = pre); it has not been merged by the maintainers, so this is a weak reference",
  "invariant": "锅炉组件稳态能量账（新旧语义共有部分）：记 QFue=燃料放热(≥0)、Qport=heatPort.Q_flow(环境→锅炉为正)、Hw=m_flow*(h_out-h_in)(工质得热)，则排烟带走的热 E = QFue + Qport - Hw 必须满足 0 ≤ E ≤ QFue；特别地 y=0（QFue=0）时 E=0，即 Hw = Qport：燃烧器关闭时工质失去的热恰等于环境收到的热，能量既不凭空产生也不被销毁。适用于 energyDynamics=SteadyState（或常输入下 t→∞）。",
  "convention_dispute": false,
  "convention_note": "热损是否计入效率是约定（新旧语义可不同），但『排烟热 ∈ [0, QFue]、y=0 时工质失热=环境得热』在两种约定下都必须成立，不依赖约定",
